  "title": "RBI Clarifies Exports Thresholds for Inward Remittances",
  "summary": "The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) clarifies that non-individual service exporters must file an Export Declaration Form only when an individual inward remittance exceeds ₹10 lakh, not on aggregate receipts, marking changes to the reporting rules for services imports and exports.",
